[Substrike]
format=1
name=Euphoric Notch
category=Hardstyle
author=Substrike
tags=hardstyle, euphoric, notch, measured
description=A hardstyle kick fitted to long, steady hardstyle tails: a biased drive and a hard clipper square off the tail, then an EQ cuts its second harmonic and lifts the top. The cut follows the keys (Chain Key Track); root C2, tail on F1.
